          {
            "typeName": "notesText",
            "multiple": false,
            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": "The data were obtained from https://www.openicpsr.org/openicpsr/project/113563/, link also provided in this folder. This zipped folder contains the STATA data file data_Deming_2008_0217.dta and STATA script file Deming_2008_0217.do. The first author made minor changes to the latter to create Deming_2008_0217_MF.do, ran it on data_Deming_2008_0217.dta to obtain data_Deming_2008_0217_MF.dta, to which Data pre-processing Deming High-School example.R was applied to obtain HS_dat.Rda.  \n\n\nThe SPISA data was provided by the second author (Mirka Henninger) as the file dat_SPISA.Rda.\n\n\nBoth files were turned into comma separated files HeadStartData.csv and SpisaData.csv using R function write.csv."
          },
